<div class="page-head"><div><h1>Help Center</h1><p>Panduan singkat penggunaan SCM Procurement.</p></div></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="help-card"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3"></i><h3>Procurement Workflow</h3><p>Request → KAK → Sourcing → Evaluation → Award → Contract → Monitoring.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="help-card"><i class="bi bi-stars"></i><h3>AI Copilot</h3><p>Gunakan Generate KAK, Review KAK, Vendor Analysis, Contract Risk, dan Draft Email.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="help-card"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i><h3>Governance</h3><p>AI hanya memberikan rekomendasi. Approval dan keputusan procurement tetap pada user berwenang.</p></div></div></div><div class="card p-4 mt-4"><h3 class="section-title">Quick Tips</h3><div class="report-checks"><div><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Pastikan KAK lengkap sebelum RFQ.</div><div><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Gunakan Vendor Performance saat evaluasi berkala.</div><div><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Monitor expiry dan obligation secara rutin.</div><div><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Semua perubahan kontrak melalui Change Order & Approval.</div></div></div>
